Package: acp-red-star
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libavif-bin | imagemagick | ffmpeg, xdg-utils
Suggests: python3, ffmpeg, yt-dlp
Description: Scrape Red Star (acp.us/rs) posts into SQLite and export them
 Logs in to https://acp.us/rs, scrapes posts, mentions and profiles for one or
 more nicks into a local SQLite database, downloads attachments, and exports
 JSON/HTML. Search, export, import and maintenance work offline. Run with
 no flags for a terminal UI that browses the database and drives scans.
